    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 33,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "In Terra del Fuego. The \"land of fire\" - A blighted and loveless country on the earths furthest rim - there lives a community of the dirtiest, the rudest, the least civilised beings you can imagine."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 604,
        "text": "Dear Hooker, I have today despatched to John Murray the completed manuscript. Who knows if anyone will buy it and how they will respond. No doubt many will wish al diabolo altogether. But least it is out in the world now and no longer torturing me."
      }
    },
